{"product_id":"grand-blue-dreaming-3","title":"Grand Blue Dreaming 3","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe hit comedy manga comes to print by popular demand! Swimsuits! Ramen! Dumb jokes! Beer! Uncomfortable nudity!RUMORS EVERYWHEREThe word around school is that Iori has a hot girlfriend--which couldn't be further from the truth. But pesky little concepts like \"truth\" don't matter to the male campus population: Iori's supposed good fortune has turned him into their most hated enemy, and he may not escape with his skin intact. Then, the diving club gets an unexpected new member--and she's a girl! But boy or girl, none of them will survive unscathed the greatest horror of college life: The mixer.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 145 x 208\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Kimitake Yoshioka\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781632366689\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 192\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45413373542553,"sku":"Manga-A-39781632366689","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68302a5f45558-Grand-Blue-Dreaming-3-_1.jpg?v=1748277074","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/grand-blue-dreaming-3","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}